00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.080
They have really long arms.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:11.500
"Freshwater Prawns"
"Macrobrachium"
They have really long arms.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.450
"Freshwater Prawns"
"Macrobrachium"
Wow, they really are long!

