They even have special rigs
for freshwater prawns.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.700
"Freshwater Prawns"
Wow, I guess they have rigs for anything.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:03.410
Wow, I guess they have rigs for anything.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:09.830
The end you tie to your pole is a loop.
Then you create another loop,

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:13.750
