00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.830
But there are types you pull the
lines through and some that latch on.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.120
And then we have fasteners.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.660
You just slip that on
and it'll keep your line in place.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:44.790
And lastly, the shrimp hook.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.160
It's so small.

